        "title": "Connect to the MyŠkoda Public API",
        "description": "Create an API key in the MyŠkoda app (Settings → API keys, app version 8.16 or newer, see {url}) and select the vehicles it may access. The API has no vehicle list, so also enter the VIN of every vehicle covered by the key.",
